  "asserted_semantics": [
    "Reports are command feedback, not document state: no transaction, no Undo entry; a reporting-only command returns request=None.",
    "A committed reporting command produces Started, its Progress/Warn reports in order, then Finished(Committed).",
    "A refused command keeps Started then Finished(Refused) and its reports are discarded, because a failed invocation publishes nothing.",
    "Reports are bounded: 32 per command, 512 bytes each, one line without control characters; exceeding a bound is a refusal rather than a truncation.",
    "Plugin reports join the existing EventLog the Command line surface and observers already consume; no second feedback path is added."
  ],
